	•	Participants (Selection Bias): Unclear | Quote/Reasoning: This was a single-center retrospective cohort, which limits generalizability, although exclusions were prespecified and the sample was moderately sized for a transplant study.  ￼
	•	Predictors (Input Variable Bias): Low Risk | Quote/Reasoning: Predictors were routinely collected recipient, donor, operative, and early post-transplant variables, and feature selection was handled systematically with bootstrapped RSF importance.  ￼
