	•	Analysis (Modeling Bias): Low Risk | Quote/Reasoning: Strengths include separate training/test cohorts, multiple imputation, bootstrapped variable selection, grid-search tuning, calibration/discrimination assessment, and direct benchmark comparison to Cox regression.  ￼
